# The images are built from the Go module, the module with DuckDB, the
# benchmark harness it uses and the three trees of the tool, and the
# licence the image carries, and from nothing else in the folder: no
# personal file, no database and no build output reaches the builder.
*
!go.mod
!go.sum
!analytics
!bench
!cmd
!fado
!internal
!LICENSE
**/*.exe
**/*.test
**/*.out
**/*.prof
**/*.db
**/*.db-wal
**/*.db-shm
**/*.fado
**/*.fado-wal
**/*.fado-shm
**/*.lock
**/*.duckdb
**/*.duckdb.wal
